{"summary":"服部平次登场并与柯南展开推理较量的重要早期案件。","sources":["src-detective-conan-world-manga","src-detective-conan-world-characters","src-detective-conan-world-diplomat-case"],"relatedEpisodes":["episode-0048","episode-0049"],"culprit":{"zhHans":"津村公江（Kimie Tsujimura）。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"motive":{"zhHans":"为女儿雪子及山城家遭受的旧案复仇；她认为丈夫津村功曾参与毁掉山城家的人生。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"method":{"zhHans":"先用安眠药使丈夫昏睡，再用藏在钥匙扣吊坠中的毒针刺杀；随后利用钥匙扣和鱼线布置假密室，制造受害者死于封闭房间的假象。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"evidence":{"zhHans":"毒针与钥匙扣、安眠药、鱼线布置、假密室机关以及案件现场的时间和物证相互印证。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"resolution":{"zhHans":"公江在推理揭示后认罪并向警方投案；她请求高志照顾雪子，高志答应，案件结束。","en":null,"translationStatus":"human","translationSourceHash":"da39a3ee5e6b"},"deepSpoilers":true,"detailStatus":"deepSpoilers","updatedAt":"2026-10-27","dcwPage":"Diplomat_Murder_Case","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Kogoro Mouri","Ran Mouri","Heiji Hattori","Shinichi Kudo","Juzo Megure","Detective Boys","Yukiko Katsuragi","Takayoshi Tsujimura","Sonoko Suzuki"],"solvedBy":"Shinichi Kudo","dcwAirDate":"February 17, 1997 (Part 1)","dcwMangaCaseNumber":"#25"}